terialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"High Environmental Stress Crack Resistance (ESCR)","exposure":"Not applicable","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08479","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"Very high thermal properties superior to Ultem 1010","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08480","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"Sterilization capable, including EtO gas, radiation, steam autoclaving, plasma, dry heat and cold sterilization","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08481","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"Exceptional strength and modulus, even at elevated temperatures","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08482","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"Resists most common automotive fluids including gasoline, antifreeze, transmission fluids, motor oils, power steering fluid, windshield washer fluid (ESCR, 24 hrs, 100C)","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08483","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"Inherently flame retardant with low smoke evolution and low smoke toxicity","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08484","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"Excellent dimensional stability with low creep sensitivity, low and uniform coefficient of thermal expansion, and highly reproducible part-to-part dimensions.","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08485","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"Polyether Sulfone (PES or PESU) is a high-temperature aromatic sulfone polymer that exhibits xceptional thermal, mechanical, and chemical resistance properties.","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08486","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"ThermaX PES is an amorphous polymer and has excellent dimensional stability and creep resistance.","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08487","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Benefits","text":"PES has higher temperature resistance and toughness than Ultem 1010, offering the ability to print parts with higher mechanical properties at elevated temperature.","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08488","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Printing advice","text":"Heated Chamber Recommended","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m412).","sourceId":"XP-thermax-pes-1","locator":"p. 1"},{"id":"Q08489","materialId":"M101","gradeId":"G101-01","topic":"Nozzle wear","text":"Nozzle Specs No special concerns","exposure":"Read 2026-10-07 in the maker's document by the completeness round and checked on the cached page (m